.pnpm-store/
.vite/
# Node build output, scoped to where a bundler would write it. A bare `dist/` also matches
# src/Web/wwwroot/lib/bootstrap/dist, which is vendored stylesheet the app links to and must be
# committed — without it a clean clone builds an unstyled app that 404s on its own CSS.
/dist/
**/wwwroot/dist/

